<title>USA: Shoney's Inc Q2 revs up, shr, net down.</title>
<headline>Shoney's Inc Q2 revs up, shr, net down.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit  $0.11	  profit  $0.15</p>
<p> Net     profit  5,293	  profit  6,426</p>
<p> Revs		295,409		  257,712</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  48,589		   41,726</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.17	  profit  $0.70</p>
<p> Net    loss     8,476	  profit  30,533</p>
<p> Revs		658,699		  557,889</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  48,557		   46,896</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Operating results for the first two quarters 1997 included special charges totaling $17.6 million ($11.2 million net of tax) for impairment of long-lived assets to adjust carrying values of under-performing restaurants to estimated fair value.</p>
<p>Excluding the effect of the charge the company's income from continuing operations for the first two quarters was $2.7 million, or $0.06 a share.</p>
</text>
